{"words": [{"text": "۞ لَّيْسَ", "translation": "It is not"}, {"text": "ٱلْبِرَّ", "translation": "[the] righteousness"}, {"text": "أَن", "translation": "that"}, {"text": "تُوَلُّوا۟", "translation": "you turn"}, {"text": "وُجُوهَكُمْ", "translation": "your faces"}, {"text": "قِبَلَ", "translation": "towards"}, {"text": "ٱلْمَشْرِقِ", "translation": "the east"}, {"text": "وَٱلْمَغْرِبِ", "translation": "and the west"}, {"text": "وَلَـٰكِنَّ", "translation": "[and] but"}, {"text": "ٱلْبِرَّ", "translation": "the righteous[ness]"}, {"text": "مَنْ", "translation": "(is he) who"}, {"text": "ءَامَنَ", "translation": "believes"}, {"text": "بِٱللَّهِ", "translation": "in Allah"}, {"text": "وَٱلْيَوْمِ", "translation": "and the Day"}, {"text": "ٱلْـَٔاخِرِ", "translation": "[the] Last"}, {"text": "وَٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةِ", "translation": "and the Angels"}, {"text": "وَٱلْكِتَـٰبِ", "translation": "and the Book"}, {"text": "وَٱلنَّبِيِّـۧنَ", "translation": "and the Prophets"}, {"text": "وَءَاتَى", "translation": "and gives"}, {"text": "ٱلْمَالَ", "translation": "the wealth"}, {"text": "عَلَىٰ", "translation": "in"}, {"text": "حُبِّهِۦ", "translation": "spite of his love (for it)"}, {"text": "ذَوِى", "translation": "(to) those"}, {"text": "ٱلْقُرْبَىٰ", "translation": "(of) the near relatives"}, {"text": "وَٱلْيَتَـٰمَىٰ", "translation": "and the orphans"}, {"text": "وَٱلْمَسَـٰكِينَ", "translation": "and the needy"}, {"text": "وَٱبْنَ", "translation": "and (of)"}, {"text": "ٱلسَّبِيلِ", "translation": "the wayfarer"}, {"text": "وَٱلسَّآئِلِينَ", "translation": "and those who ask"}, {"text": "وَفِى", "translation": "and in"}, {"text": "ٱلرِّقَابِ", "translation": "freeing the necks (slaves)"}, {"text": "وَأَقَامَ", "translation": "and (who) establish"}, {"text": "ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ", "translation": "the prayer"}, {"text": "وَءَاتَى", "translation": "and give"}, {"text": "ٱلزَّكَوٰةَ", "translation": "the zakah"}, {"text": "وَٱلْمُوفُونَ", "translation": "and those who fulfill"}, {"text": "بِعَهْدِهِمْ", "translation": "their covenant"}, {"text": "إِذَا", "translation": "when"}, {"text": "عَـٰهَدُوا۟ ۖ", "translation": "they make it"}, {"text": "وَٱلصَّـٰبِرِينَ", "translation": "and those who are patient"}, {"text": "فِى", "translation": "in"}, {"text": "ٱلْبَأْسَآءِ", "translation": "[the] suffering"}, {"text": "وَٱلضَّرَّآءِ", "translation": "and [the] hardship"}, {"text": "وَحِينَ", "translation": "and (the) time"}, {"text": "ٱلْبَأْسِ ۗ", "translation": "(of) [the] stress"}, {"text": "أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ", "translation": "Those"}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "translation": "(are) the ones who"}, {"text": "صَدَقُوا۟ ۖ", "translation": "are true"}, {"text": "وَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ", "translation": "and those"}, {"text": "هُمُ", "translation": "[they]"}, {"text": "ٱلْمُتَّقُونَ", "translation": "(are) the righteous"}], "sahih": "Righteousness is not that you turn your faces toward the east or the west, but [true] righteousness is [in] one who believes in Allāh, the Last Day, the angels, the Book, and the prophets and gives wealth, in spite of love for it, to relatives, orphans, the needy, the traveler, those who ask [for help], and for freeing slaves; [and who] establishes prayer and gives zakāh; [those who] fulfill their promise when they promise; and [those who] are patient in poverty and hardship and during battle. Those are the ones who have been true, and it is those who are the righteous."}